{
    "comment": "마이페이지 프로필에 붙는 내 마일리지 요약 카드.\n  숫자를 따로 불러오지 않는다 — 로그인 사용자 정보(`user.data.ecommerce_mileage`)에 이커머스가\n  이미 실어 보낸 값을 읽기만 한다. 그래서 이 조각에는 데이터소스가 없고, 카드가 안 보이면\n  원인은 이 파일이 아니라 그 응답에 마일리지가 실렸는지에 있다.\n  기능을 끈 상태에서도 카드는 남고 안내문만 대신 나온다(관리자 회원 상세의 마일리지 탭과 같은 규약).",
    "target_layout": "mypage/profile",
    "priority": 320,
    "injections": [
        {
            "target_id": "mypage_tab_content",
            "position": "append_child",
            "components": [
                {
                    "id": "ext_my_mileage_card",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:mt-4 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-200 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-700 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:p-5"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:justify-between ecommerce:mb-3"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "H3",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-white ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "coins",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:text-gray-600 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.user_mileage.title"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "비활성화 안내 (mileage.enabled=false)",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "if": "{{!user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.enabled}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.user_mileage.disabled_notice"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.enabled}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:justify-between"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.user_mileage.available"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce:font-bold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-white"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.available ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} P"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "if": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.expiring_soon ?? 0) > 0}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-amber-700 ecommerce:dark:text-amber-400 ecommerce:mt-1"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.user_mileage.expiring_soon|amount={{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.expiring_soon ?? 0).toLocaleString()}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "view_my_mileage_history",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "A",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "navigate"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "href": "/mypage/mileage",
                                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-1 ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-400 ecommerce:hover:underline"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.user_mileage.view_history"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "arrow-right",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
